    <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
      <body>
        <div rend="parallel">
            <p xml:id="Aink448-kilavi">vēntaṟku uṟṟuḻippirinta talaimakaṉ paruvam vantaviṭattiṉum mīḷappeṟātu aracaṉ ceytiyum paruvattiṉ ceytiyum taṉ ceytiyum kūṟi āṟṟāṉ āyatu.</p>
            <p xml:lang="en">The hero, who had separated for a royal emergency, not obtaining [leave] to return even when the season [of his intended departure] had arrived, decalring the act of the king, the act of the season, and his own act, spoke [this].</p>
              </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
          <lg xml:id="Aink448">        
            <l>taḻaṅkuraṉ muracaṅ kālai yiyampak</l>
            <l>kaṭuñciṉa vēntaṉ ṟoḻiletirn taṉaṉē</l>
            <l>mellavaṉ maruṅkiṉ mullai pūppap</l>
            <l>poṅkupeyaṟ kaṉaituḷi kāretirn taṉṟē</l>
            <l>yañci lōtiyai yuḷḷutoṟun</l>
            <l>tuñcā talamara ṉāmetirn taṉamē.</l>
        </lg>  
 <lg xml:lang="en">                    
<l>As the rattling<note xml:lang="en" place="foot">The edition consulted records <foreign xml:lang="ta-Latn">taḻaṅkukural</foreign> as a variant, which I think is the intended meaning of the phrase. The contracted form <foreign xml:lang="ta-Latn">taḻaṅkural</foreign> is presumably a shortening for the sake of metre, as the longer version would be hypermetrical, and it is common enough to be lexicalised in the TL. <foreign xml:lang="ta-Latn">taḻaṅ(ku)kural muracam</foreign> is a common formula, connoting a loud banging war drum.</note> wardrums sound in the morning,</l>
<l>the king of fierce anger accepted the task.</l>
<l>As the jasmine in the soft depressions flower,</l>
<l>the rainy season of raging rains and intense drops accepts [its task].<note xml:lang="en" place="foot"><foreign xml:lang="ta-Latn">erirtal</foreign> here doesn't have an obvious object, so I supply 'the task' - the subject of each of the three sentences of the poem is seemingly bound to some undertaking in response to an external factor, i.e. have a task they much undertake.</note></l>
<l>Everyime [I] remember [her] pretty delicate hair,</l>
<l>I accept tossing and turning without sleep.</l>
</lg>                      
        </div>
      </body>
    </text>
